# The galaxies carry SnapNum 62 and the halo snapshot is 63 (Age and ZZ from a scratch
# restatement of SAGE26's time_to_present on the run's a_list, R/src/core_init.c:159-206).
# Converted back to code units: OutflowRate (times deltaT), TimeOfLast*Merger (divided by
# UnitTime_in_Megayears); histories: every bin holds the output SFR in code units and ColdGas or
